          "chars": 21,
          "sentences": 1,
          "questions": 1,
          "firstAudioMs": null,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 1,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "这听着挺让人担心的。您先别慌，也别急着按对方说的操作，咱们慢慢理一理。",
          "chars": 31,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 656,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "千万别转，这是典型的诈骗。银行绝不会让您把钱转到所谓的安全账户，您赶紧挂断电话，别理他。",
          "chars": 39,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 719,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "kind": "reply",
          "text": "验证码是最后一道防线，打死也不能给。您直接挂断电话，千万别再跟他纠缠了。",
          "chars": 32,
          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 718,
          "mentioned": false
        }
      ]
    },
